        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DRB1006138BR, Victorian Sliding Pocket Door Flush Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian Pocket Door Flush Pull made by First Impressions is a great addition to any sliding door. A beautiful way to add old world style to your home, the Darby 1 Flush Pull comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. Choose from a wide array of finishes including black, satin brass, and polished chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush pull has a 90 degree bend that wraps 1/4\" on to the door's edge. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian Style Pocket Door hardware is also available as a <a href=\"/products/victorian-sliding-pocket-door-privacy-lock-first-impressions-drb1006brpvc\"><b>Privacy Lock Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/victorian-sliding-pocket-door-passage-set-first-impressions-drb1006brpsg\"><b>Passage Lock Set</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Darby Collection Series 1 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Depth: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DRB01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262215\"><b>First Impressions DRB1006138BR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged as a set that includes 2 flush pulls. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
